---
interface Props { img?: string; alt?: string }
const {
  img = '/media/library/svhgpt-05-the-cup-receiving.webp',
  alt = 'Two cupped hands holding a small, warm ember of light.',
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="tw-honest tw-section">
  <div class="tw-honest-inner">
    <div class="tw-honest-media" data-reveal>
      <img
        src={img}
        alt={alt}
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="tw-honest-text" data-reveal>
      <p class="tw-eyebrow">An honest note</p>
      <h2 class="tw-h2">This won’t be twelve weeks of <em>feeling wonderful.</em></h2>
      <p class="tw-p">
        Here’s what no course page usually admits. Sometimes you’ll feel lighter.
        Sometimes you’ll meet something tender first. If all you want is a pleasant
        hour, there are gentler tools, and they’re good ones.
      </p>
      <p class="tw-p">
        But if you’re willing to meet the parts that have been waiting — the old fear,
        the grief, the anger — what’s on the other side isn’t a quick lift. It’s a
        steadier kind of peace. More lasting. More structurally yours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
